WEBVTT

00:01.920 --> 00:05.790
Helck travels to the Demon Lord's castle
and comes upon Azudra.

00:05.790 --> 00:09.630
Azudra speaks of the demon's desire
to forge a friendly relationship with humanity,

00:09.630 --> 00:12.210
which Helck tries to convey
to his fellow humans.

00:12.210 --> 00:16.290
However, the people show nothing but hate
as they lash out at some captured demons.

00:16.290 --> 00:20.250
Not long after, the kingdom reveals a new
secret weapon in the form of awakened warriors,

00:20.250 --> 00:23.080
which they plan to use
to wage war on the demonkin.

00:24.040 --> 00:25.040
Helck...

00:25.630 --> 00:28.500
Please. I really need your help.

00:49.500 --> 00:52.040
Aa, touzen mitai ni tsuyosa kazashite

00:52.040 --> 00:54.210
Noudo mashiteku rettoukanjou

00:54.210 --> 00:56.170
Umareta toki kara

00:56.170 --> 00:58.330
Kimatterutte oshietoite yo

00:58.330 --> 01:00.080
Risoukyou no otonari san

01:00.080 --> 01:02.330
Zetsubou ga sa hora "konnichiwa"

01:02.330 --> 01:04.380
Daremo kizukanai no wa

01:04.380 --> 01:06.540
Kou ka fukou ka?

01:06.540 --> 01:09.750
Nando mezamete mo

01:09.750 --> 01:12.880
Akumu no you dana

01:12.880 --> 01:16.250
Kurushii dake nara

01:16.580 --> 01:18.380
Kamisama douka boku o tsukurikaete kuranai ka

01:18.380 --> 01:22.290
Kamisama douka boku o tsukurikaete kuranai ka

01:22.290 --> 01:24.420
Aa, nanmannen mo bokura wa

01:24.420 --> 01:27.000
Mirai ni kibou idakinagara

01:27.000 --> 01:28.880
Douse otozureru ketsumatsu ni

01:28.880 --> 01:31.170
Aragou to surun da

01:31.170 --> 01:32.830
Nankai me no inori da

01:32.830 --> 01:35.170
Kokoro karada kawari hatete

01:35.170 --> 01:39.580
Magamono datte nan datte shinjitakute

01:39.710 --> 01:43.080
Are, boku wa ima ikiteru no?

01:43.080 --> 01:45.880
Mou wake wakannai ya

01:45.880 --> 01:47.880
Helck me tasukete yo

02:01.080 --> 02:06.040
<b>The Truth Behind Awakening</b>

02:06.040 --> 02:14.080
<b>Heavy Infantry Commander</b>

02:06.040 --> 02:14.080
<b>Zeruzeon</b>

02:06.880 --> 02:08.790
You want my help?

02:09.580 --> 02:11.330
Unless we do something soon,

02:11.330 --> 02:14.130
the kingdom will turn into something horrific
that it will never recover from.

02:14.130 --> 02:15.290
Hold on.

02:15.290 --> 02:17.080
You're going to need to explain more than that.

02:17.290 --> 02:19.210
I'm talking about the power of "awakening."

02:19.210 --> 02:21.790
Trust me. It's going to destroy this country.

02:22.330 --> 02:24.670
You've seen the
awakened warriors before, right?

02:24.670 --> 02:25.630
Yeah.

02:25.630 --> 02:28.210
The majority of those were felons
who committed serious crimes.

02:28.790 --> 02:30.790
They had been stuck in prison for ages,

02:30.790 --> 02:33.580
so their bodies were frail enough
to be worthless.

02:33.580 --> 02:34.630
But then...

02:34.630 --> 02:36.710
after going through the awakening process,

02:36.710 --> 02:39.420
they were suddenly able to fight
with an outrageous amount of power.

02:40.920 --> 02:44.210
Do you really think it's possible
to become that strong without any risk?

02:45.250 --> 02:48.710
The spell they use to trigger the change
does more than just grant strength.

02:48.710 --> 02:49.750
It's a spell?

02:49.750 --> 02:52.130
The awakening process destroys the mind.

02:52.130 --> 02:53.710
You lose all sense of self.

02:53.710 --> 02:56.790
Turning you into a puppet that does nothing
but obey the will of the spellcaster.

02:58.330 --> 03:00.630
Those warriors aren't human anymore.

03:00.630 --> 03:02.790
They're something even worse than slaves!

03:03.000 --> 03:04.670
And the kingdom's upper echelon

03:04.670 --> 03:08.670
intends to cast that spell on every citizen
who isn't a member of nobility.

03:09.540 --> 03:12.000
Wait a second!
What will become of the kingdom?!

03:12.000 --> 03:16.880
They're trying to remake this kingdom into
a new world that exists solely for nobility!

03:17.460 --> 03:20.920
They have an awakening plan that
they're going to put in motion on a huge scale.

03:21.540 --> 03:23.630
I don't know exactly how it will work.

03:23.630 --> 03:26.250
But their goal is to awaken everyone
at the same time.

03:26.790 --> 03:28.040
And I...

03:28.040 --> 03:30.790
am supposed to play a role
in part of that plan.

03:31.000 --> 03:31.790
What?!

03:31.790 --> 03:33.170
Don't get me wrong!

03:33.170 --> 03:34.880
I'm firmly against the whole thing.

03:34.880 --> 03:37.210
And there are a number
of other people on my side.

03:37.790 --> 03:40.540
What about Mr. Mikaros and Mr. Raphaed?

03:40.540 --> 03:42.750
Are they on board with this?

03:42.750 --> 03:46.580
Actually, the Great Sage Mikaros is the one
who devised this whole plan.

03:47.330 --> 03:51.080
Everyone from the King, to Lord Raphaed,
to the members of the senate...

03:51.080 --> 03:54.250
The plan has progressed with the unanimous
agreement of the kingdom's elite.

03:54.250 --> 03:55.210
Helck...

03:55.500 --> 03:58.130
You can't trust anyone in the upper echelons!

03:58.130 --> 04:00.500
Especially Master Mikaros and Lord Raphaed.

04:00.500 --> 04:02.710
I've watched them up close for a long time.

04:02.710 --> 04:06.170
I've felt them giving off a very strange
and ominous aura more than once.

04:06.710 --> 04:10.380
We have to put a stop to this plan,
no matter what.

04:10.380 --> 04:14.540
Otherwise, all the commoners,
and even your mercenary friends...

04:14.960 --> 04:18.000
are going to end up
as brainless awakened warriors.

04:18.000 --> 04:20.750
But how exactly
do you intend to stop them?

04:20.920 --> 04:23.540
Because the chance of us beating
those awakened warriors is pretty slim,

04:23.540 --> 04:25.330
even if we amassed an army.

04:25.330 --> 04:28.790
We won't need that many people, since we're
only trying to throw a wrench into the works.

04:29.250 --> 04:32.630
The spell that's used to trigger awakening
is the crux of their entire plan,

04:32.630 --> 04:34.920
and it can't be used by just anybody.

04:34.920 --> 04:36.710
It requires an exceptional spellcaster,

04:36.710 --> 04:39.580
and a specific individual
who acts as the key to it all.

04:39.580 --> 04:40.580
Key?

04:40.580 --> 04:44.290
A person endowed with a special ability
that invokes the spell.

04:44.290 --> 04:48.330
In other words, the plan can't proceed if
those two people are taken out of the picture.

04:48.330 --> 04:50.830
All right, so who exactly is this spellcaster?

04:50.830 --> 04:52.210
The King!

04:52.790 --> 04:53.830
What?!

04:53.830 --> 04:56.540
But the problem is that only a handful
of people are privy to his whereabouts.

04:56.540 --> 05:00.080
Not to mention it's unrealistic to go after
someone who would be so heavily guarded.

05:00.080 --> 05:01.330
So our target is...

05:01.330 --> 05:03.790
the other person who acts as the key to it all.

05:03.960 --> 05:05.540
Cless the Hero!

05:05.830 --> 05:08.000
We'll snatch him from
the clutches of the kingdom

05:08.000 --> 05:10.210
and put an end to their awakening plan!

05:10.790 --> 05:12.960
Cless? Are you serious?

05:12.960 --> 05:16.670
Just so you know,
Cless hasn't endorsed this plan in any way.

05:16.880 --> 05:20.580
Actually, he still hasn't
regained consciousness.

05:20.580 --> 05:23.380
They're just using him like a tool
to put their plan in motion.

05:23.540 --> 05:26.710
So, ultimately, we would also
be saving Cless by doing this.

05:26.960 --> 05:29.380
All right. So that's why you came to me.

05:29.380 --> 05:31.500
That wasn't the only reason.

05:31.500 --> 05:35.130
They've put Cless under heavy guard
because he's so essential to the plan.

05:35.130 --> 05:37.330
So if we want to force our way through
and rescue him,

05:37.330 --> 05:40.670
then we're going to need someone with
outstanding skills and strength like you.

05:42.880 --> 05:44.500
I've heard the stories!

05:44.500 --> 05:47.880
Like how you stood up to a monster after
it wiped out a battalion of a hundred soldiers

05:47.880 --> 05:49.460
and then defeated it by yourself.

05:49.460 --> 05:51.380
Wrong. It was battalion of 500 soldiers.

05:51.380 --> 05:54.790
Or how you managed to vanquish
over 50 monsters in less than an hour.

05:54.790 --> 05:56.210
It was more than 200.

05:56.210 --> 05:59.670
Or how you came really close to reaching
the Demon Lord's castle on a solo expedition!

05:59.670 --> 06:01.830
He marched right in
and came back totally unharmed!

06:02.290 --> 06:03.790
Are you a freak of nature or what?!

06:03.790 --> 06:05.580
Hey, fathead! Watch your mouth!

06:07.250 --> 06:08.420
On top of all that,

06:08.420 --> 06:12.040
I was told you were the most reliable person
to go to if things got bad.

06:13.080 --> 06:15.500
By my good friend... Cless.

06:16.540 --> 06:18.540
He and I joined the army at the same time.

06:18.540 --> 06:21.670
And we've spent years fighting our way
through a number of deadly battles together.

06:22.790 --> 06:23.960
It's all right.

06:23.960 --> 06:25.210
As long as my brother is around,

06:25.210 --> 06:27.250
it doesn't matter how many
monsters invade the kingdom

06:27.250 --> 06:29.460
because he'll find a way to take care of them.

06:29.460 --> 06:31.830
It's thanks to him that
I can depart on this expedition

06:31.830 --> 06:34.380
to defeat the Demon Lord
without a second thought.

06:34.790 --> 06:38.290
So if anything happens to me,
you should go to my brother for help.

06:38.920 --> 06:40.960
He's far stronger than I am.

06:40.960 --> 06:43.000
And the most reliable person you'll ever find.

06:44.830 --> 06:46.210
I see...

06:46.630 --> 06:47.960
Please!

06:48.080 --> 06:51.880
I didn't spend all that time and effort serving
the kingdom for things to turn out like this!

06:51.880 --> 06:54.580
I want to protect the people
and the peace of this land!

06:55.130 --> 06:57.580
And above all else, I want to save my friend!

06:57.880 --> 07:00.040
Someone has to help Cless!

07:00.750 --> 07:02.920
Cless is blessed to have a friend like you.

07:04.420 --> 07:06.330
I would be more than happy to help.

07:06.630 --> 07:08.630
Thank you. I owe you big time.

07:08.630 --> 07:10.130
You can count me in, too.

07:11.130 --> 07:13.330
I was listening in while you talked.

07:13.330 --> 07:15.790
I'd rather die than be some noble's puppet.

07:15.790 --> 07:16.880
Alicia!

07:16.880 --> 07:17.880
Hold on!

07:17.880 --> 07:20.170
Participating in this is akin
to treason against the crown!

07:20.420 --> 07:22.250
So I'm going to take care of it alone!

07:22.250 --> 07:25.920
Okay, but this guy
clearly wants us to help out, too.

07:25.920 --> 07:27.710
That's why he filled in Edil
on all the details, right?

07:27.880 --> 07:29.330
Given the situation,

07:29.330 --> 07:31.830
I figured that you people were the best option
among a bunch of awful ones.

07:31.830 --> 07:33.540
You don't have to phrase it like that!

07:33.540 --> 07:35.420
I'm totally onboard with helping out.

07:35.420 --> 07:37.710
There's no way in hell
they're getting away with this.

07:37.710 --> 07:40.420
I have a responsibility to keep
the innocent people of the kingdom safe!

07:40.920 --> 07:41.750
But then...

07:41.750 --> 07:44.540
Nope! You don't get a say in this Helck.

07:44.540 --> 07:47.500
Because shouldering the burden alone
is always your solution to everything.

07:47.500 --> 07:49.880
It's okay for you to rely
on your comrades a little more.

07:51.460 --> 07:55.130
So, with that settled, we're all going
to stop this evil scheme together!

07:55.130 --> 07:56.130
Thank you.

07:56.130 --> 07:58.500
Now let's hear the details of your game plan.

07:58.500 --> 08:00.630
Oh, and be sure to keep your voice down,

08:00.630 --> 08:02.710
I could you hear you
all the way from my room.

08:02.710 --> 08:04.170
What?! Are you serious?!

08:04.170 --> 08:06.380
Yeah. You've got a loud voice.

08:08.880 --> 08:10.750
We made our move.

08:11.460 --> 08:13.040
Get the hell out here, dammit!

08:14.040 --> 08:15.130
What is going on?!

08:15.130 --> 08:16.830
Apparently some of the townspeople
have started rioting outside!

08:16.830 --> 08:18.380
Huh?! But what for?!

08:18.380 --> 08:19.750
Enough of your damn chatter!

08:19.750 --> 08:21.500
Get out there and keep the peace, now!

08:21.500 --> 08:22.290
Yessir!

08:23.830 --> 08:26.330
The rioting was part of Zeruzeon's plan.

08:26.630 --> 08:29.790
It helped to reduce the number of guards
in the castle as much as possible.

08:31.000 --> 08:32.630
Okay, the coast is clear.

08:35.710 --> 08:36.920
Go! Go! Go!

08:36.920 --> 08:38.420
Keep your voice down!

08:40.290 --> 08:42.710
It's almost surprising
how smoothly this is going.

08:42.710 --> 08:44.710
The real trouble starts here.

08:49.420 --> 08:51.500
They haven't noticed us yet!
Let's make the first move!

08:53.420 --> 08:55.000
Damn, they caught on!

08:55.000 --> 08:56.670
Yeah, because you keep shouting!

08:56.670 --> 08:57.710
Stay calm!

08:57.710 --> 09:00.000
Dealing with only one of them
should be easy enough!

09:00.000 --> 09:01.790
Uh, there's actually a huge crowd of them!

09:01.790 --> 09:03.080
Whatever! Don't lose your cool!

09:03.080 --> 09:04.040
Too late for that!

09:04.210 --> 09:05.250
Bring it on.

09:08.210 --> 09:09.170
Here they come!

09:14.540 --> 09:17.130
It's okay! Let's just fight like usual!

09:17.130 --> 09:18.080
Right!

09:29.210 --> 09:30.380
We did it...

09:30.380 --> 09:31.330
Yeah!

09:31.330 --> 09:33.420
Okay! Let's press on ahead!

09:44.920 --> 09:46.830
We've almost made it
to the room that Cless is in!

09:46.830 --> 09:48.500
Assuming we make it through this okay,

09:48.500 --> 09:50.920
we'll have to come up with a plan
to handle the monsters and demons next.

09:50.920 --> 09:51.920
Yeah.

09:56.420 --> 09:59.750
There's a good chance
we won't have to fight against the demonkin.

09:59.750 --> 10:00.540
Huh?!

10:00.830 --> 10:02.170
Truth be told,

10:02.170 --> 10:05.670
I actually met with one of them
when I went to the Demon Lord's castle.

10:06.540 --> 10:08.630
And he told me something surprising.

10:08.880 --> 10:12.920
The monsters attacking the kingdom
weren't being sent or controlled by the demons.

10:13.540 --> 10:15.960
They actually have nothing to do with it.

10:16.540 --> 10:20.500
And more importantly,
he told me they want peace with us.

10:25.080 --> 10:27.250
That's so typical of you, Sir Helck.

10:27.250 --> 10:30.830
But listen, you can't just go
taking them at their word like that.

10:30.830 --> 10:32.960
The demonkin are crafty and despicable.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.290
There are many historical records

10:34.290 --> 10:37.460
that show the human race has
almost been wiped out due to their treachery.

10:38.170 --> 10:42.210
That demon probably noticed your strength
and fed you a bunch of lies to avoid fighting.

10:42.210 --> 10:44.880
At the very least,
all the demons that I've come across

10:44.880 --> 10:47.540
were bloodthirsty bastards that
were impossible to reason with.

10:47.790 --> 10:49.540
O-oh, really?

10:49.540 --> 10:50.750
You're a good guy, Helck.

10:50.750 --> 10:53.330
You show kindness
to everyone without exception.

10:53.500 --> 10:57.130
But you have to realize there are many people
in this world who are simply beyond help.

10:57.130 --> 11:00.210
And demons in particular are creatures
that you should always be wary of.

11:00.460 --> 11:04.500
Because the demonkin have treated us
like an enemy throughout all of human history.

11:05.670 --> 11:09.040
Though, it would be amazing
if what you heard turned out to be true.

11:10.250 --> 11:13.880
There's nothing better than finding a way to
resolve things peacefully instead of fighting.

11:14.420 --> 11:16.040
So, here's the deal, Helck.

11:16.040 --> 11:18.750
When we're finished with things here,
let's go and find out for sure.

11:19.880 --> 11:21.080
Alicia!

11:21.080 --> 11:22.670
Talk about being reckless.

11:22.670 --> 11:24.630
Whatever, Edil, you can just stay behind.

11:24.630 --> 11:26.130
No! I'll accompany you.

11:26.130 --> 11:29.210
Oh, unless I'd be getting in the way
of your special alone time.

11:29.210 --> 11:30.330
H-huh?!

11:30.330 --> 11:33.290
We're all going together!
I never said it would just be the two of us!

11:33.290 --> 11:34.580
Turn it down!

11:34.580 --> 11:35.790
You're being too loud!

11:44.710 --> 11:46.380
Cless is up that way.

11:59.040 --> 12:00.130
Something's not right.

12:00.130 --> 12:01.460
It's too quiet.

12:01.460 --> 12:03.540
But it definitely feels like someone is here...

12:03.540 --> 12:06.250
Keep on your toes.
I've got a bad feeling about this.

12:21.170 --> 12:22.250
CLESS!

12:22.960 --> 12:24.130
No, wait!

12:35.130 --> 12:39.080
And just what do you think
you're doing in here, Zeru?

12:48.330 --> 12:49.630
Master Mikaros!

12:50.080 --> 12:52.710
Actually, there's no need to explain.

12:52.710 --> 12:55.830
I always noticed from the beginning
that your response to my plan

12:55.830 --> 12:57.750
wasn't exactly favorable.

12:57.960 --> 13:01.830
I must say, I'm not a fan
of that part of your personality.

13:02.250 --> 13:04.960
I thought you were a more sensible man.

13:05.210 --> 13:07.920
But no, you're just another disgrace.

13:07.920 --> 13:10.630
Master Mikaros!
Please, don't go through with this!

13:10.630 --> 13:12.080
A country exists for its people!

13:12.080 --> 13:15.330
There's absolutely no way that
doing this will ever lead to true peace!

13:15.920 --> 13:17.790
You utter fool.

13:18.580 --> 13:21.000
I can't believe that a member
of the nobility such as yourself

13:21.000 --> 13:22.710
would actually be opposed to the plan.

13:22.710 --> 13:23.880
Senator...

13:24.500 --> 13:26.580
Even someone with your pea-brain

13:26.580 --> 13:30.670
should be able to comprehend just
how reasonable and beneficial this plan is.

13:30.670 --> 13:33.210
The people are not going to die.

13:33.210 --> 13:35.170
We are only awakening their inner power,

13:35.170 --> 13:39.540
thereby upgrading their bodies
to make them more efficient workers.

13:39.540 --> 13:41.750
Productivity will go through the roof!

13:41.750 --> 13:45.250
Plus, every single person within the kingdom
will have enough power

13:45.250 --> 13:47.000
to fight back against the monsters!

13:47.000 --> 13:50.920
Not to mention, it will make them completely
obedient and unable to defy our orders!

13:50.920 --> 13:52.210
Screw that!

13:52.210 --> 13:56.000
We weren't born into this world
just to become your slaves!

13:56.000 --> 13:58.040
I think it's cause for celebration.

13:58.040 --> 14:01.130
Their lives are being blessed with purpose
by serving us, after all.

14:01.290 --> 14:03.830
Surely you all must have noticed it, too.

14:03.830 --> 14:06.750
The stupidity of the inferior class
knows no bounds.

14:06.750 --> 14:08.880
They take no action of their own,

14:08.880 --> 14:11.710
only yelling and complaining about
the peace that's been gifted to them.

14:11.920 --> 14:15.000
Becoming our livestock is what they deserve.

14:15.000 --> 14:16.000
You scumbags!

14:16.000 --> 14:18.790
Enough talk!
Let's just finish what we came for!

14:30.580 --> 14:32.540
It's... the King!

14:34.130 --> 14:35.670
S-so that's him?

14:38.250 --> 14:39.710
Kneel before me.

14:45.330 --> 14:47.540
Wh-what the hell is going on?

14:47.960 --> 14:50.540
H-his words have so much weight...

14:51.040 --> 14:54.250
It feels like I'm being physically
pushed into the ground.

14:54.670 --> 14:58.420
This plan was enacted by
the collective will of the kingdom.

14:58.420 --> 15:03.540
Those who raise an objection to it for
whatever reason shall be regarded as criminals.

15:03.880 --> 15:06.630
I hereby order you. Take your own lives.

15:11.380 --> 15:13.380
I can't control my body!

15:15.880 --> 15:17.420
Take our own lives?

15:17.880 --> 15:19.790
That's a sick joke.

15:19.790 --> 15:21.750
I WON'T DO IT!

15:22.170 --> 15:24.790
He has the power to defy the King's order, eh?

15:24.790 --> 15:26.710
Hmm. How interesting.

15:26.710 --> 15:28.710
Hey, guys! Are you okay?

15:28.710 --> 15:30.960
Y-yeah. Thanks to you.

15:30.960 --> 15:32.000
Sorry about that.

15:33.420 --> 15:34.420
Oh my!

15:34.420 --> 15:37.130
The effects of the
King's divine tongue were broken!

15:37.130 --> 15:38.830
The only way that could happen

15:38.830 --> 15:42.290
is for these people to regard that man
as someone higher than the King!

15:44.130 --> 15:46.710
I'll be taking Cless back now.

15:46.710 --> 15:47.670
Mikaros!

15:47.670 --> 15:49.250
Summon the awakened soldiers!

15:49.250 --> 15:51.330
No, that would be pointless.

15:51.330 --> 15:55.040
Awakened soldiers aren't going
to be enough to defeat this man.

15:55.040 --> 15:57.630
That's how much power he wields.

15:58.000 --> 15:59.830
Fine, then how are you going to handle this?

15:59.830 --> 16:01.210
Have no fear.

16:01.210 --> 16:04.960
We already have the perfect
opponent for him to fight right here.

16:07.250 --> 16:08.960
Cless the Hero!

16:10.130 --> 16:11.790
I hereby order you.

16:11.790 --> 16:14.380
Kill all the traitors!

16:26.460 --> 16:28.330
C-Cless...

16:28.330 --> 16:31.330
Something is happening to him
besides just being controlled by the King!

16:32.040 --> 16:35.040
What is that dark aura surrounding him?

16:35.040 --> 16:35.960
Cless!

16:35.960 --> 16:38.000
Stop it! Get a hold of yourself!

16:38.210 --> 16:40.670
Look! It's me, your brother! Helck!

16:41.710 --> 16:43.000
Don't you recognize me?!

16:43.000 --> 16:44.460
You cannot reach him.

16:44.460 --> 16:49.040
Cless has been stripped of all agency
and is being controlled by a superior power.

16:49.330 --> 16:51.540
Your voice is falling on deaf ears.

16:51.790 --> 16:54.000
Mr. Mikaros! What happened to you?!

16:54.000 --> 16:55.420
Why are you doing this?!

16:55.540 --> 16:59.540
You've already heard all the details
of my plan from Zeru, right?

16:59.540 --> 17:04.460
I had been searching for the individual
who could act as the key for a very long time.

17:04.460 --> 17:07.460
Until that one snowy day when we first met...

17:07.710 --> 17:10.920
As Cless lay there on the verge of death,

17:10.920 --> 17:14.380
I discovered a special power
buried deep within him.

17:15.130 --> 17:17.790
It was exactly what I had been searching for.

17:17.790 --> 17:21.500
The ability to draw upon power
from the other world!

17:22.540 --> 17:26.500
A special ability that only
Cless the Hero has access to.

17:28.750 --> 17:31.710
Meeting Cless was
an unbelievable stroke of luck.

17:32.040 --> 17:34.630
I might not have come across him
even with a thousand years of searching.

17:34.830 --> 17:38.630
That's just how
exceedingly rare his ability is.

17:38.920 --> 17:42.080
But I wasn't able to start my plan right away.

17:42.420 --> 17:45.460
His body was vastly underdeveloped.

17:45.750 --> 17:48.000
So it was necessary to level up

17:48.000 --> 17:51.250
his physical prowess to the point
that he could withstand my spell, you see.

17:52.540 --> 17:56.880
But fortunately, the unexpected outbreak of
monsters around the kingdom made it quite easy.

17:56.880 --> 18:00.920
Although I pushed him so hard
that he almost bit the dust a number of times,

18:00.920 --> 18:05.130
he safely reached the level
that I needed him to be at.

18:05.130 --> 18:10.130
And now I intend to have Cless work very hard
to help make my plan a reality.

18:10.790 --> 18:12.080
Mikaros!

18:12.080 --> 18:13.460
L-let's go help him!

18:13.460 --> 18:15.040
We would only be getting in the way!

18:15.500 --> 18:16.830
I miscalculated.

18:17.040 --> 18:19.710
I never thought that we would end up
having to fight against Cless!

18:21.920 --> 18:24.210
Helck, that's enough! We have to retreat!

18:26.960 --> 18:29.170
Cless! It's me, Helck!

18:29.170 --> 18:30.880
Come back to your senses!

18:31.750 --> 18:35.210
It's impressive that you're able to put up
this much of a fight against Cless.

18:35.210 --> 18:38.130
I imagine that you could even kill him,
if you wanted to.

18:39.210 --> 18:42.460
That is one way you could
stop my plans, you know?

18:42.790 --> 18:44.540
But that's not going to happen.

18:44.540 --> 18:47.880
You couldn't bear to take the life of your
precious little brother with your own hands.

18:49.170 --> 18:51.210
Just give up already.

18:51.380 --> 18:54.380
There is simply no way for you
to overcome this situation.

18:55.130 --> 18:56.630
It's impossible.

19:06.790 --> 19:09.170
So you landed a hit by catching him off guard.

19:09.170 --> 19:10.500
But it doesn't change anything.

19:10.500 --> 19:14.500
Since paltry attacks like those
have absolutely no effect on Cless.

19:15.960 --> 19:16.960
What?!

19:17.170 --> 19:19.380
That should hardly have scratched him!

19:19.380 --> 19:21.080
N-no, impossible!

19:21.460 --> 19:22.290
Cless!

19:22.290 --> 19:25.250
Sh-she really hurt him.
How did she manage that?!

19:25.250 --> 19:28.420
W-well, I've never
actually fought a Hero before,

19:28.420 --> 19:30.420
so I was only half-convinced
that it would work...

19:30.420 --> 19:33.960
but I guess this blade really is imbued with
an incredible power that lives up to its name.

19:34.460 --> 19:36.250
Did I hit him too hard?

19:36.250 --> 19:37.920
I hope he's okay.

19:37.920 --> 19:40.170
That blade... it can't be...

19:40.170 --> 19:42.170
The Hero Slayer?!

19:42.330 --> 19:43.710
This is a surprise.

19:43.710 --> 19:46.710
I didn't think anyone outside
of my immediate family knew that name.

19:46.960 --> 19:48.500
I knew it!

19:48.500 --> 19:49.920
"Hero Slayer"?

19:49.920 --> 19:50.960
Look!

19:50.960 --> 19:53.960
Her attack seems to have
stopped Sir Cless cold.

19:54.880 --> 19:56.630
Cless has been defeated?!

19:56.630 --> 19:58.330
What kind of sword is that?!

19:58.330 --> 20:01.330
Now's our chance!
Grab Cless and get out of here!

20:01.330 --> 20:04.040
Call the awakened soldiers!
Kill them all!

20:04.210 --> 20:05.210
Helck!

20:05.210 --> 20:08.040
Is he okay?
I'm sorry for getting rough on him.

20:08.040 --> 20:11.500
His consciousness seems to be fading
in and out, but I think he's okay.

20:11.500 --> 20:12.750
Thank you.

20:12.750 --> 20:14.750
Whatever you did saved him.

20:15.080 --> 20:17.880
Don't mention it.
Come on, let's get out of here.

20:19.670 --> 20:20.880
Attack now!

20:23.000 --> 20:24.420
Helck! You go on ahead!

20:24.420 --> 20:25.790
Take Cless and run for it!

20:25.790 --> 20:27.250
We'll hold them off!

20:27.250 --> 20:28.250
Thanks!

20:29.460 --> 20:30.290
Dear me.

20:30.290 --> 20:33.130
How could I have guessed that you
were carrying such a dreadful weapon?

20:35.080 --> 20:38.460
I can't even remember the last time
I actually felt fear like this.

20:38.460 --> 20:39.670
However...

20:39.670 --> 20:41.750
that's a double-edged sword.

20:41.750 --> 20:44.830
And you made a big mistake
in revealing it to me.

20:46.250 --> 20:48.210
STOP IT!

20:48.210 --> 20:51.540
You've seen Helck's
overwhelming power firsthand.

20:52.790 --> 20:56.040
Did you seriously think
that he was just another regular human?

20:56.750 --> 20:58.380
I'm going to borrow this.

21:02.080 --> 21:03.460
You amateurs.

21:03.460 --> 21:04.710
This is what happens...

21:06.670 --> 21:08.420
when you underestimate my power.

21:24.290 --> 21:27.920
Nee, bokura ga egaiteita yume wa nandakke

21:27.920 --> 21:31.130
Nee, bokura ga egaiteita yume wa nandakke

21:31.750 --> 21:35.710
Chiisakute doro darake demo daiji na omoide

21:35.710 --> 21:39.130
Chiisakute doro darake demo daiji na omoide

21:39.880 --> 21:43.580
Migi mo hidari mo wakaranai bukakkou na boku no

21:43.580 --> 21:46.670
Migi mo hidari mo wakaranai bukakkou na boku no

21:47.630 --> 21:54.540
Te o hiite tasukete kureta suzushii manazashi

21:55.630 --> 21:59.500
Daijoubu daijoubutte iinagara

21:59.500 --> 22:03.420
Kimi wa nando mo boku o dakishimeta

22:03.420 --> 22:06.790
Atatakai kono te o kondo wa boku ga nigirunda

22:06.790 --> 22:10.000
Atatakai kono te o kondo wa boku ga nigirunda

22:11.250 --> 22:18.420
Kimi no namae o sakenda sekai wa waratta

22:18.710 --> 22:22.670
Tsunagi tomeru sono kotoba ga nani yori toutoi

22:22.670 --> 22:25.790
Tsunagi tomeru sono kotoba ga nani yori toutoi

22:26.920 --> 22:34.080
Kore ga bokura no unmei naraba nurikaeyou

22:34.380 --> 22:38.380
Kurayami no sono mukou gawa

22:38.380 --> 22:45.380
Tomo ni tsukamaeru hikari

22:46.080 --> 22:50.880
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:46.080 --> 22:50.880
<b>Traitors</b>

